<!--stopped here; kr/31.05.04, 11:00 Unordered Lists list-style may be empty for lists with no bullet or other symbol default list-style is 'bullets' Recommended id = ulis01, ulis02, etc.-->
<!ELEMENT ul  (li+) >

<!--Ordered Lists: attribute 'ol-style' - recommded use: ... 1 arabic numbers 1, 2, 3, ... a lower alpha a, b, c, ... A upper alpha A, B, C, ... i lower roman i, ii, iii, ... I upper roman I, II, III, ...-->
<!ELEMENT ol  (li+) >

